OL,3,GNEWSARock legends memorabilia goes
OL,4,Aunder the hammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FArtwork by John Lennon and sunglasses
OL,7,Fworn by Jim Morrison are among almost
OL,8,F200 pieces of rock memorabilia set to
OL,9,Fgo under the hammer in Surrey.
OL,11,FThe collection, up for sale at Ewbank's
OL,12,Fin Woking later, has been owned by
OL,13,Fentrepreneur Alex Worrall for more than
OL,14,Ffive decades, and also includes items
OL,15,Flinked to David Bowie, Jimi Hendrix,
OL,16,FQueen, and Pink Floyd, among others.
OL,18,FWorrall said his links to music royalty
OL,19,Fbegan in the 1960s, when he worked as a
OL,20,Froadie for The Move and visited
OL,21,FLondon's Abbey Road Studios while The
OL,22,FBeatles and Pink Floyd were recording.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
