OL,4,Aunder the hammer
OL,5,
OL,6,FHe also claimed to have crossed paths
OL,7,Fwith Morrison at Abbey Road and later
OL,8,Fmet Lennon and artist Andy Warhol
OL,9,Fduring trips to New York.
